Thanks for coming to see me today, everyone! Have fun!

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,200
覚えてるかな？ 最初のうた
Do you remember? That very first song,

8
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,800
私 声が震えていた (ほんのすこし)
my voice was trembling just a little bit.

9
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,000
あの日から続く未来は
The future that started from that day

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,500
みんなと掴んだ今日だよ
is today, which we grasped together with everyone.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
もっともっともっともっともっと加速するハート
